  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 73ff519377b990a4c81cd1461a3c1f62, type: 3}
  m_Name: AlingRiza_W66_Teach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: Aling Riza
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Sursuruentayo dagiti sasao a makatulong kadatayo a mangsarita maipapan
    kadagiti tattao.


    Iti Ilokano, ti ''siak'' ket kayatna a saoen ti ''I.''


    Usarem
    daytoy no pagsasaritaanmo ti bagim.


    Denggem a naimbag: siak.


    Ita,
    padasem nga ibagam ti ''siak'' iti bukodmo a timek.'
  translatedText: 'Let''s learn words that help us talk about people.

    In Ilokano,
    ''siak'' means ''I.''

    You use it when referring to yourself.

    Now, try
    saying ''siak'' yourself.'
